eholders, and 2 defined fields (meeting_topic, attendees). Form accepted submission with all required fields provided.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After submission, new template \\\"Quick Meeting Notes\\\" immediately appears in template library grid. Result count updated from 6 to 7 templates. Template visible with correct title, 0 uses, and updated date (2026-08-26). No page reload required.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"All template cards display: title (e.g., Professional Resume), author (Sarah Chen), description, category (Resume), scenario (Business), usage count (1,250 uses), and update date (Updated 2024-12-01). Verified for all 6 visible templates.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Built-in Markdown template 'Weekly Status Report' generates preview with properly rendered: H1 heading, H2 section headings, strong/bold emphasis for labels, horizontal separator line, and line breaks between sections. All field values correctly substituted into Markdown structure. Template formatting preserved and displayed correctly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category filter by 'Meeting Minutes' reduced results from 7 to 2 templates (Meeting Minutes + Quick Meeting Notes). Sort changed to 'Alphabetical' with correct order. Result count updated immediately without page reload. All filters and sorts applied successfully: Category, Scenario, and Sort dropdown options working and visible results updated accordingly.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Search query \\\"resum\\\" (missing 'e' from \\\"resume\\\") still returns \\\"Professional Resume\\\" in both suggestions and filtered results. Demonstrates fuzzy matching with small