nvalid format prevented preview generation. Format validation enforced.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Attempt to submit template with all empty required fields (Title, Author, Description, Content) was rejected. Form remained open with empty fields, no submission occurred. All required fields marked with (*) must be filled. Submission prevented without nonblank values in all required fields.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Fields reject special characters: [ ] brackets marked as errors in Full Name, Email, Position, Degree fields. Error message: 'Special characters like < > { } [ ] \\\\\\\\ | ` are not allowed'. Restricted characters successfully neutralized/rejected. Other characters like ** # * allowed where not Markdown-breaking. Validation prevents format corruption.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Preview Result tab disabled when required fields contain validation errors (invalid email format, special characters). Tab cannot be clicked when errors exist. Preview remains unavailable until all required fields have valid, non-error values. Validation prevents invalid content generation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-27\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Field/placeholder mapping not validated. Unresolved placeholders appear in preview instead of being replaced with field values.\", \"actual\": \"Custom template 'Quick Meeting Notes' with defined fields 'meeting_topic' and 'attendees' and placeholders {meeting_topic} and {attendees} in content was submitted successfully. Preview showed literal placeholders {meeting_topic} and {attendees} instead of substituted values. No validation error prevented submission of mismatched fields and placeholders.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-29\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Duplicate field labels accepted and submitted. No validation preventing duplicate field names.\", \"actual\": \"Added field 'test_field' twice to form. Both instances accepted. Template with duplicate fields successfully submitted and appeared in library as 'Duplicate Field Test'. Template count increased from 7 to 8. Duplicate field labels should have been rejected or disambiguated before submission.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing \\\"res\\\" (2 characters) displays suggestions including \\\"Professional Resume\\\", \\\"Responsibilities\\\", \\\"In Progress\\\", \\\"Academic Research Summary\\\", \\\"Research Title\\\". Results filtered to 4 matching templates. Clicking suggestion fills search box and narrows results. Real-time filtering works without page reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Category filter changed from 'All Categories' to 'Meeting Minutes' reduced count from 7 to 2. Sort changed from 'Most Popular' to 'Alphabetical' reordered templates. Search query \\\"resum\\\" filtered to 1 result. All updates instant without page reload, result count and template order updated live.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-22\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"When form opened with empty required fields, UI displayed: 'Required fields missing Please fill in: Full Name, Job Title, Email, Professional Summary, Company Name, Position, Start Date, Responsibilities, Degree, School, Graduation Year, Skills'. List shows all missing required fields. Message updates when fields have validation errors preventing preview.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-24\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Favorite toggle for Professional Resume changed state from 'off' to 'on' immediately. Favorites button updated to show 'Favorites 1' with visual count display. Adding second favorite (Meeting Minutes) incremented count to 'Favorites 2'. Unfavoriting immediately reverses state. All feedback instantaneous without reload.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-25\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Valid Markdown template renders correctly: headings (H1, H2) display as formatted text, emphasis (bold) applied to labels, separators rendered as horizontal lines, line breaks preserved between sections. Field values substituted preserve Markdown structure. Professional Resume plain-text and Weekly Status Report Markdown both render with proper formatting.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-26\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting custom template 'Quick Meeting Notes' immediately updated result count from '6 of 6 templates' to '7 of 7 templates' without page reload. New template appeared in grid instantly. Template available for selection and use right after submission. Verified count update and immediate library availability.\"}]}"
